{"slug":"/references/utils/ProductUtils/classes/utils.ProductUtils.CSVNormalizer","title":"CSVNormalizer","frontmatter":{},"toc":[{"title":"constructor","id":"constructor","level":2},{"title":"Parameters","id":"constructor-parameters","level":3},{"title":"Methods","id":"methods","level":2},{"title":"preProcess","id":"preprocess","level":3},{"title":"Parameters","id":"preprocess-parameters","level":4},{"title":"Returns","id":"preprocess-returns","level":4},{"title":"proccess","id":"proccess","level":3},{"title":"Parameters","id":"proccess-parameters","level":4},{"title":"Returns","id":"proccess-returns","level":4}],"blocks":[{"kind":"markdown","html":"CSV normalizer processes all the allowed columns from a CSV file and remaps\nthem into a new object with properties matching the \"AdminCreateProduct\".\n\nHowever, further validations must be performed to validate the format and\nthe required fields in the normalized output."},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"text":"constructor","id":"constructor"},{"kind":"heading","level":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"constructor-parameters"},{"kind":"typeList","sectionTitle":"constructor","types":[{"name":"rows","type":"[NormalizedRow](/references/utils/types/utils.NormalizedRow)[]","description":"","optional":false,"defaultValue":"","expandable":false,"children":[{"name":"product id","type":"`string`","description":"","optional":true,"defaultValue":"","expandable":false,"children":[]},{"name":"product handle","type":"`string`","description":"","optional":false,"defaultValue":"","expandable":false,"children":[]}]}]},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"text":"Methods","id":"methods"},{"kind":"heading","level":3,"text":"preProcess","id":"preprocess"},{"kind":"markdown","html":"Normalizes a row by converting all keys to lowercase and removing\nthe leading \"\\r\" from the keys and the values.\n\nAlso, it values the row to contain unknown columns and must contain\nthe \"product id\" or \"product handle\" columns."},{"kind":"heading","level":4,"text"